  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Match List I and List II</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">List I</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">List II</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>A</td>\t\t\t<td>Microwaves</td>\t\t\t<td>I</td>\t\t\t<td>Physiotherapy</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>B</td>\t\t\t<td>UV rays</td>\t\t\t<td>II</td>\t\t\t<td>Treatment of cancer</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>C</td>\t\t\t<td>Infra-red rays</td>\t\t\t<td>III</td>\t\t\t<td>Lasik eye surgery</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>D</td>\t\t\t<td>X-rays</td>\t\t\t<td>IV</td>\t\t\t<td>Aircraft navigation</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>Choose the correct answer from the option given below:</p>",
